msgstr "Segera hadir"

msgid "Sultan POS · Setup"
msgstr "Sultan POS · Penyiapan"

msgid "Sultan setup"
msgstr "Penyiapan Sultan"

msgid "Welcome to Sultan"
msgstr "Selamat datang di Sultan"

msgid "How will this computer be used? Pick with the arrow keys or 1 to 4, then press Enter."
msgstr "Komputer ini akan dipakai untuk apa? Pilih dengan tombol panah atau 1 sampai 4, lalu tekan Enter."

msgid "Single app"
msgstr "Aplikasi tunggal"

msgid "One shop on one computer: the server and the register run together."
msgstr "Satu toko di satu komputer: server dan kasir berjalan bersama."

msgid "HQ server"
msgstr "Server HQ"

msgid "Head office: keeps the master data. Terminals on the network connect to it."
msgstr "Kantor pusat: menyimpan data master. Terminal di jaringan terhubung ke sini."

msgid "Branch server"
msgstr "Server cabang"

msgid "A shop server with a copy of the HQ data. Needs HQ sync."
msgstr "Server toko dengan salinan data HQ. Butuh sinkronisasi HQ."

msgid "Terminal"
msgstr "Terminal"

msgid "A register that connects to a server on the shop network."
msgstr "Kasir yang terhubung ke server di jaringan toko."

msgid "Database"
msgstr "Database"

msgid "Where the HQ server keeps its data. A MySQL database must already exist."
msgstr "Tempat server HQ menyimpan datanya. Database MySQL harus sudah ada."

msgid "SQLite file"
msgstr "File SQLite"

msgid "MySQL server"
msgstr "Server MySQL"

msgid "Network"
msgstr "Jaringan"

msgid "Terminals connect to this address. 0.0.0.0 listens on every network; the server has no TLS yet, so keep it on the shop network."
msgstr "Terminal terhubung ke alamat ini. 0.0.0.0 mendengarkan di semua jaringan; server belum memakai TLS, jadi gunakan hanya di jaringan toko."

msgid "Your shop"
msgstr "Toko Anda"

msgid "The company and its first branch. The branch code appears in document numbers."
msgstr "Perusahaan dan cabang pertamanya. Kode cabang muncul di nomor dokumen."

msgid "Same as the code"
msgstr "Sama dengan kode"

msgid "Time zone"
msgstr "Zona waktu"

msgid "WIB (Jakarta)"
msgstr "WIB (Jakarta)"

msgid "WITA (Makassar)"
msgstr "WITA (Makassar)"

msgid "WIT (Jayapura)"
msgstr "WIT (Jayapura)"

msgid "Owner account"
msgstr "Akun pemilik"

msgid "The owner logs in to back office with the password and to the register with the PIN."
msgstr "Pemilik login ke back office dengan kata sandi dan ke kasir dengan PIN."

msgid "Connect to the server"
msgstr "Hubungkan ke server"

msgid "Type the address of the single app or HQ server, e.g. 192.168.1.10 or 192.168.1.10:8080."
msgstr "Ketik alamat aplikasi tunggal atau server HQ, misalnya 192.168.1.10 atau 192.168.1.10:8080."

msgid "Manager login"
msgstr "Login manajer"

msgid "A manager with back-office rights registers this terminal. The login is used once and not stored."
msgstr "Manajer dengan hak back office mendaftarkan terminal ini. Login hanya dipakai sekali dan tidak disimpan."

msgid "This terminal"
msgstr "Terminal ini"

msgid "Pick the branch and name this register, e.g. R2 and Kasir 2."
msgstr "Pilih cabang dan beri nama kasir ini, misalnya R2 dan Kasir 2."

msgid "Type the one-time code issued in back office (valid for 10 minutes)."
msgstr "Ketik kode sekali pakai dari back office (berlaku 10 menit)."

msgid "All set"
msgstr "Semua siap"

msgid "The shop {} (branch {}) is ready. The Start screen opens next: F1 opens the register; log in with the owner PIN."
msgstr "Toko {} (cabang {}) sudah siap. Berikutnya layar awal terbuka: F1 membuka kasir; masuk dengan PIN pemilik."

msgid "More cash registers later? Start screen → Settings (F3) → Terminals in this shop: allow terminals to connect, then set up each terminal with the address shown there."
msgstr "Nanti perlu kasir tambahan? Layar awal → Pengaturan (F3) → Terminal di toko ini: izinkan terminal terhubung, lalu siapkan setiap terminal dengan alamat yang ditampilkan di sana."

msgid "The HQ server for {} (branch {}) is set up."
msgstr "Server HQ untuk {} (cabang {}) sudah disiapkan."

msgid "This computer is now register {} ({}) at {}."
msgstr "Komputer ini sekarang kasir {} ({}) di {}."

msgid "Start the server with this command, then register terminals:"
msgstr "Jalankan server dengan perintah ini, lalu daftarkan terminal:"

