msgid "Customer balance (saved change)"
msgstr "Saldo pelanggan (simpan kembalian)"

msgid "When coins for change are short, the cashier can save the change to the customer's balance; it pays a later sale. These limits apply to every branch."
msgstr "Jika uang receh untuk kembalian kurang, kasir bisa menyimpan kembalian ke saldo pelanggan; saldo itu membayar penjualan berikutnya. Batas ini berlaku di semua cabang."

msgid "0 per sale turns saving change off. A merge may go over the most balance."
msgstr "0 per penjualan mematikan simpan kembalian. Penggabungan boleh melebihi saldo maksimal."

msgid "Erase the personal data of {}?"
msgstr "Hapus data pribadi {}?"

msgid "The name becomes “Erased customer”; phone, email, birthday, address, company, tax data and notes are blanked and the customer is archived. Sales and receipts stay. This cannot be undone."
msgstr "Nama menjadi “Erased customer”; telepon, email, ulang tahun, alamat, perusahaan, data pajak, dan catatan dikosongkan, lalu pelanggan diarsipkan. Penjualan dan struk tetap ada. Ini tidak bisa dibatalkan."

msgid "The balance is {}: the erase is refused until it is spent or paid out at the till."
msgstr "Saldonya {}: penghapusan ditolak sampai saldo dipakai atau dicairkan di kasir."

msgid "Type the member code {} to confirm"
msgstr "Ketik kode member {} untuk konfirmasi"

msgid "Erase"
msgstr "Hapus data"

msgid "Listing and searching customers needs the permission {}. You can still add a customer (Ctrl+N)."
msgstr "Melihat dan mencari pelanggan butuh izin {}. Anda tetap bisa menambah pelanggan (Ctrl+N)."

msgid "Type a name (1 to 100 characters)."
msgstr "Ketik nama (1 sampai 100 karakter)."

msgid "Not a phone number: use 8 to 15 digits, e.g. 0812-3456-789."
msgstr "Bukan nomor telepon: pakai 8 sampai 15 angka, mis. 0812-3456-789."

msgid "Not an email address."
msgstr "Bukan alamat email."

msgid "A tax ID (NPWP or NIK) has 15 or 16 digits."
msgstr "NPWP atau NIK terdiri dari 15 atau 16 angka."

msgid "Not a date: type the day and the month (the year is optional)."
msgstr "Bukan tanggal: ketik tanggal dan bulan (tahun opsional)."

msgid "Type the date as YYYY-MM-DD, e.g. 2027-12-31."
msgstr "Ketik tanggal sebagai TTTT-BB-HH, mis. 2027-12-31."

msgid "Pick a tier first."
msgstr "Pilih tingkat dulu."

msgid "This phone is already used by the customer {}."
msgstr "Telepon ini sudah dipakai pelanggan {}."

msgid "The customer is archived. Unarchive the customer first."
msgstr "Pelanggan ini diarsipkan. Aktifkan lagi dulu."

msgid "This customer was merged into another customer."
msgstr "Pelanggan ini sudah digabungkan ke pelanggan lain."

msgid "Cannot erase: the balance is {}. It must be spent or paid out at the till first."
msgstr "Tidak bisa dihapus: saldonya {}. Saldo harus dipakai atau dicairkan di kasir dulu."

msgid "The group or tier no longer exists. Refresh and pick again."
msgstr "Grup atau tingkat itu sudah tidak ada. Muat ulang dan pilih lagi."

msgid "The customer is archived. The till no longer finds the customer."
msgstr "Pelanggan diarsipkan. Kasir tidak bisa menemukannya lagi."

msgid "The customer is active again."
msgstr "Pelanggan aktif lagi."

msgid "The personal data is erased."
msgstr "Data pribadi sudah dihapus."

msgid "Merged. The customer {} was kept."
msgstr "Digabungkan. Pelanggan {} dipertahankan."

msgid "Pick the duplicate in the list and the customer to keep."
msgstr "Pilih duplikat di daftar dan pelanggan yang dipertahankan."

msgid "That is the same customer. Type the code of the customer to keep."
msgstr "Itu pelanggan yang sama. Ketik kode pelanggan yang dipertahankan."

msgid "No active customer has this code or phone."
msgstr "Tidak ada pelanggan aktif dengan kode atau telepon ini."

msgid "The rank is a whole number."
msgstr "Peringkat harus bilangan bulat."

msgid "Another tier has this rank."
msgstr "Tingkat lain sudah memakai peringkat ini."

msgid "Type an amount in Rupiah, 0 or more."
msgstr "Isi jumlah dalam Rupiah, 0 atau lebih."

msgid "(No group)"
msgstr "(Tanpa grup)"

msgid "(No tier)"
msgstr "(Tanpa tingkat)"

msgid "Change saved"
msgstr "Kembalian disimpan"

msgid "Paid with the balance"
msgstr "Dibayar dengan saldo"

msgid "Saved change reversed"
msgstr "Simpan kembalian dibatalkan"

msgid "Payment reversed"
msgstr "Pembayaran dibatalkan"

msgid "Paid out in cash"
msgstr "Dicairkan tunai"

msgid "Moved by a merge"
msgstr "Dipindah karena penggabungan"

msgid "Received by a merge"
msgstr "Diterima dari penggabungan"
